{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-0bf96a2b3c2e3c2ef7b21548ef2536f26157fb143bc6561b","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"ab15f71544ba557b77cc432d5c08cca0a5a5fa97d6e3d34e0d7598084e4aafbb","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 37 (Calculation of Net Tonnage)\n(1) Net tonnage shall be the sum of the values under items 1 and 2 (only the value under item 1 for a ship with a passenger capacity of fewer than 13 persons), expressed in measurement tons.\n1. The value obtained by multiplying the total volume of cargo spaces less the total volume of excluded spaces included in those cargo spaces by the coefficient calculated by the following formula (where the resulting value is less than 25 percent of international gross tonnage, 25 percent of that international gross tonnage):\n\n(0.2 + 0.02 log₁₀Vc) × (4d/(3D))²\n\nVc: Total volume of cargo spaces less the total volume of excluded spaces included in those cargo spaces.\nD: Moulded depth at the midpoint of the length of the ship.\nd: Vertical distance, at the midpoint of the length of the ship, from the lower end of the moulded depth to the reference draught line (75 percent of the moulded depth for a ship for which no reference draught line is specified).\n\nWhere the value of (4d/(3D))² is 1 or greater, that value shall be taken as 1.\n\n2. The value calculated by the following formula on the basis of passenger capacity and international gross tonnage:\n\n(1.25 × (T + 10,000)/10,000) × (N₁ + N₂/10)\n\nT: International gross tonnage.\nN₁: Number of passengers accommodated in cabins with a capacity of not more than 8 persons.\nN₂: Total passenger capacity less N₁.\n\n(2) Where there is a minor change in the position of the reference draught line or passenger capacity (meaning a change which causes no change in the volume of enclosed spaces, cargo spaces or excluded spaces) and the net tonnage of the ship decreases because of that change, its net tonnage shall, for one year from the date on which the international tonnage certificate or tonnage certificate under Article 13 of the Act was first issued (the date of the latest issuance of an amended certificate if an amended certificate concerning a change of net tonnage has been issued), be calculated on the basis of the position of the reference draught line or the passenger capacity at the relevant point of change. However, this shall not apply to a passenger ship carrying large numbers of passengers without berths installed. <Amended on June 30, 2021>\n(3) Where the net tonnage calculated under paragraph (1) is less than 30 percent of international gross tonnage, it shall be taken as 30 percent.\n\n[Source wording annotation: Paragraph (2) of the frozen source says “at the relevant point of change” (the Korean expression contains “change-point”). That wording is preserved here and has not been silently replaced with “before the change”. The underlying source text and its hash remain unchanged.]\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-37.json","sha256":"6e9b68b007103aa578faf7674ad4abe960bc07bb3d85bf8879b400714f5af466"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-37.selfcheck.json","sha256":"f0db03c616976d17b5da54f194ddfcd5fa9f00b5078b60a7d8aea93719c5fd53"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-37.txt","sha256":"9b1cb6a8d547637ac4f72cc951be8defe1185299a7584678b086ccce75c9017b"},"unit_key":"article-37"}],"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko","component_ids":["TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko:article-37"],"component_kind":"TONNAGE_RULE","edition_id":"edition-9f91cfaa1968ebd9b7fa7f13af55d8691a515626ff4cc9ba","frozen_scope_plan_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\direct_ingest_v1\\scope_plans\\initial_scope_plan_v1.json","sha256":"2d658b90187ad6c6f619ee5d48d181f92924d5d2e947012ce68088304dcb21b3"},"human_or_official_review_claimed":false,"matrix_component_ids":["TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko:article-37"],"matrix_unit_count":1,"multilingual_schema":"20261018_multilingual_v1","parent_family_id":"KR:000068","parent_ordinal":1522,"payload_scope_id":"TONNAGE_RULE:kr-007467-233591-ko#body_unit:article-37","preserved_ai_translation_evidence":[],"provider":"OpenAI ChatGPT WORKC_G01_P04","reused_translation_evidence":[],"scope":"EXACT_SOURCE_UNIT_SET","scope_tag":"body_unit:article-37","source_binding":{"actual_ack":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\acknowledgements\\WORKC_G01_P04_1522_20261019_R2.json","sha256":"c7d1b66e898618f4425577b4dd26d33eea603895d28be6d944451cea513ec7dd"},"binding":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tools\\source_bindings\\TONNAGE_RULE.v1.json","sha256":"d08c2cc8dffc4488126876ea31402ede5a4ede6e0fbb1072ecb145591a008b9f"},"component_manifest":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\inventory_v1\\component_manifest.TONNAGE_RULE.v1.json","sha256":"da5362b58cbb95087fe6314c77559fe386dcdd68b8f5dedd94b851dbe3f9b26a"},"formal_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\inputs\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\input.json","sha256":"01e3dbe95ca728336f66a43437c1c1b9d3b9bce62b0acae19ca3d72be11209d8"}},"source_body_sha256":"48fb03f08910e36b3bd72867668123ed0e063c19a5636fe306400af68ec6478e","source_component_text_sha256":"3791929770e37d014e30c2a86b6002915685a0887e255728f4d13ce69ec6a25d","source_fragment_reuse_evidence":[],"source_preflight_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\direct_ingest_v1\\source_preflight.json","sha256":"99458a5fdfcceca04aa033e81460dc7c8e93a0598f0fe453aad31142eabea3ab"},"source_temporal_metadata":{"effective":"2021-06-30","promulgated":"2021-06-30"},"source_unit_count":1,"source_unit_map":[{"kind":"ARTICLE","matrix_counted":true,"operative_db_projection_sha256":"4119d5665de685117bec0bf8c574e5f560ccd1adfae454f1d7880cbeff415d91","operative_db_projection_text":"제37조(순톤수의 산정)\n①순톤수는 제1호 및 제2호의 값을 합산한 값(여객정원이 13인 미만인 선박에서는 제1호의 값)에 용적톤을 붙인 것으로 한다.\n1. 화물적재장소의 합계용적에서 당해 화물적재장소에 포함된 제외장소의 합계용적을 뺀 값에 다음 산식에 의하여 산정되는 계수를 곱하여 얻은 값(그 값이 국제총톤수의 100분의 25가 되지 아니하는 경우에는 당해 국제총톤수의 100분의 25)\n    \n  (0.2＋0.02 log10Vc)×(  4d  )2\n                        ───\n                          3D\n\n    Vc는 화물적재장소의 합계용적에서 당해 화물적재장소에 포함되어 있는 제외장소의 합계용적을 뺀 값\n    D는 선박길이의 중앙에서의 형깊이\n    d는 선박길이의 중앙에서 형깊이의 하단으로부터 기준흘수선까지의 수직거리(기준흘수선이 정하여지지 아니한 선박은 형깊이의 75퍼센트)\n    \n  (   4d  )2\n    ───\n      3D\n의 값이 1 이상일 때에는 그 값을 1로 한다.\n2. 여객정원수 및 국제총톤수를 기준으로 하여 다음 산식에 의하여 산정되는 값\n    \n  (1.25×   T＋10,000   )×(N1＋  N2  )\n          ───────        ───\n            10,000                10\n\n    T는 국제총톤수\n    N₁은 정원8인 이하의 여객실에 대한 여객정원의 수\n    N₂는 여객정원의 총수에서 N₁을 뺀 수\n②기준흘수선의 위치나 여객정원에 대하여 경미한 변경(해당 변경에 의하여 폐위장소ㆍ화물적재장소 또는 제외장소의 용적에 변경을 일으키지 않는 것을 말한다)이 있는 경우 그 변경에 의하여 순톤수의 값이 감소하는 선박의 순톤수는 법 제13조에 따른 국제톤수증서 또는 국제톤수확인서가 최초로 교부된 날(순톤수의 변경에 관하여 변경교부를 받은 경우에는 최후로 변경교부를 받는 날)로부터 기산하여 1년간은 해당 변경점의 기준흘수선의 위치 또는 여객정원수에 의하여 산정한다. 다만, 침상이 설치되지 않은 상태로 많은 여객을 수송하는 여객선은 그렇지 않다. <개정 2021.6.30>\n③제1항의 규정에 의하여 산정된 순톤수가 국제총톤수의 100분의 30 미만일 때에는 100분의 30으로 한다.","source_component_text_sha256":"3791929770e37d014e30c2a86b6002915685a0887e255728f4d13ce69ec6a25d","source_graphic_observation_sha256":null,"source_graphic_reconciliation_sha256":null,"source_graphics":[{"asset_byte_length":1528,"asset_file":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\source_assets_v1\\files\\graphic-829791ca7bbdf0bf6a6f.gif","asset_key":"graphic-829791ca7bbdf0bf6a6f","asset_sha256":"af9d988f64e609354eaaca3776940f172e290537d230d05e275709d5c4e05475","exact_xml_node_verification":{"asset_key":"graphic-829791ca7bbdf0bf6a6f","component_kind":"TONNAGE_RULE","exact_reference":{"ancestor_chain":[{"attributes":{"법령키":"0074672021063000486"},"tag":"법령"},{"attributes":{},"tag":"조문"},{"attributes":{"조문키":"0037001"},"tag":"조문단위"},{"attributes":{},"tag":"항"},{"attributes":{},"tag":"호"},{"attributes":{},"tag":"호내용"}],"container":{"annex_title":null,"article_branch":null,"article_number":"37","article_title":"순톤수의 산정","attributes":{"조문키":"0037001"},"tag":"조문단위"},"kind":"INLINE_IMAGE_IN_XML_TEXT","source_text_end":196,"so